Commit:     ephico2real2 <123043136+ephico2real2@users.noreply.github.com>
CommitDate: Sun Oct 25 00:20:25 2026 -0500

    identity: hold kernel process incarnation through SPIRE workload attestation
    
    Retain exact CRI sandbox/container/PID state and reject ambiguous or inconsistent observations. Hold pidfd and procfs identity, require the kernel Pod UID/container cgroup binding and recheck it through SVID, bundle and final CRI join. Bound the complete credential fetch and return startup errors instead of panic. Test-only binders are explicit and cannot disable production checks.
    
    Local privileged Linux ARM64 profile passes 498 library, 20 direct, 30 namespace and 2 credential example tests, zero failures/ignored/filtered in full harnesses. Actual owned-child pidfd exit and negative/recovery cases ran. Formatting and strict Clippy including examples pass. No proxy deployment or packet protection claim; exact image credential qualification is next.
    
    Signed-off-by: ephico2real2 <123043136+ephico2real2@users.noreply.github.com>

